# Power BI Sales Dashboard

An interactive Power BI dashboard for sales analysis, built using Power BI Desktop.

## Overview
This dashboard analyzes sales data across years, regions, product categories, sales reps, sales channels and customer types, and presents key insights through interactive visuals.

## Key Metrics (Cards)
- Total Sales
- Total Quantity
- Profit Margin %
- Total Estimated Profit
- Transaction Count

## Visuals
- Line chart: Total Sales by Year-Month
- Column chart: Total Sales by Product Category
- Donut chart: Total Sales by Region
- Stacked column chart: Total Sales by Sales Channel and Customer Type
- Bar chart: Total Sales by Sales Rep

## Slicers
- Year
- Region
- Product Category
- Sales Rep
- Sales Channel
- Customer Type

## Pages
- Page 1: Sales Dashboard
- Tooltip
- Analysis

## Tools Used
- Power BI Desktop
- Power Query
- DAX

